"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">, </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Industry, Innovation, and Infrastructure (SDG 9</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">), </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Sustainable Cities and Communities (SDG 11)</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">, as well as </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Climate Action (SDG 13</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">).</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>";s:9:"guideline";s:30:"https://bit.ly/JYS25Guidelines";s:19:"main_essay_question";s:213:"As a youth leader, how have you contributed — or how do you plan to contribute — to advancing solutions within your chosen SDG focus area to create sustainable and inclusive change in your community or beyond?";s:19:"essay_guideline_url";s:23:"https://bit.ly/EssayJYS";s:7:"twibbon";s:32:"https://www.twibbonize.com/jys25";s:17:"twibbon_video_url";s:42:"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/vRQx0PFJ6xc";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-10-12 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-10-15 00:00:00";s:22:"registration_video_url";s:61:"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tUR55Fi53rM?si=NtuTc1RVhzcl7lgh";s:16:"tshirt_chart_url";s:64:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/general-files/tshirt_chart.jpg";s:5:"theme";s:45:"Pioneering Innovation for Sustainable Futures";s:10:"share_desc";s:2356:"<p><strong>Note</strong>: As mentioned in the Registration Guidelines, you need to complete the following steps:</p><ul><li>Follow our TikTok and Instagram accounts:<span style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"> </span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/youthbreaktheboundaries/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong>Youth Break the Boundaries Instagram</strong></a><strong>,</strong><span style="color: rgb(204, 224, 245);"> </span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/japanyouthsummitofficial" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong><u>Japan Youth Summit Instagram</u></strong></a>, <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@youthbreaktheboundaries" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong>Youth Break the Boundaries TikTok</strong></a>, <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@japanyouthsummitofficial" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Japan Youth Summit TikTok</strong></a></li><li>Join our Telegram channels: <a href="https://t.me/youthbreaktheboundaries" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong>Youth Break the Boundaries Telegram</strong></a>, <a href="https://t.me/japanyouthsummit" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong><u>Japan Youth Summit Telegram</u></strong></a></li><li>Subscribe to the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ybbfoundation" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong>YBB YouTube Channel</strong></a></li><li>Tag <strong>5 of your friends</strong> and <strong>@youthbreaktheboundaries</strong>, <strong>@japanyouthsummitofficial</strong> on your posted twibbon on Instagram or any other social media platform.</li><li>Share the program information for the Japan Youth Summit using this poster: <a href="https://bit.ly/JYS25Poster" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong>"Japan Youth Summit Poster"</strong></a> with 3 WhatsApp groups or any other social media groups.</li></ul><p>Take a screenshot of each action mentioned above and upload them to your storage drive. Then, copy the link and paste it into the input forms provided above. Ensure that the folder is <strong>accessible to the public</strong> and not set to private.</p>";s:17:"confirmation_desc";s:1722:"<h1>Japan Youth Summit 2025</h1><p>The Japan Youth Summit provides both <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">Fully Funded</strong> and <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">Self-Funded</strong> Opportunities. To qualify for <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">Full Funding</strong>, delegates must complete all registration steps and fulfill payment by the specified deadline. If not selected for Full Funding, delegates can still participate through a self-funded scheme.</p><p><br></p><p>The comprehensive expenses outlined in the Japan Youth Summit payment cover accommodation throughout the program (<strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">October 12 - 15, 2025</strong>), including airport transfers on the first day (<strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">October 12, 2025</strong>, for transfer from the airport to the hotel) and the last day of the program (<strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">October 15, 2025</strong>, for transfer from the hotel to the airport). It's crucial to note that all fully funded or self-funded payments do not cover flight tickets and visa expenses. The fully-funded spots will be allocated based on the registrants' quality.</p><p><br></p><p>With a delegate quota limited to only <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">200 youth</strong>, let's join hands and collaborate at the Japan Youth Summit 2025. Your contribution is <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">essential</strong> for a shared and <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">impactful</strong> experience.</p><p><br></p><p class="ql-align-center"><em>I am </em><strong><em>ready</em></strong><em> to join the Japan Youth Summit 2025 in </em><strong><em>Osaka, Japan</em></strong><em>.</em></p>";s:9:"is_active";s:1:"1";s:20:"is_registration_open";s:1:"1";s:10:"is_deleted";s:1:"0";s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2024-02-12 20:29:22";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2025-07-20 12:38:36";}}s:11:"testimonies";a:5:{i:0;a:11:{s:2:"id";s:2:"17";s:19:"program_category_id";s:1:"6";s:11:"person_name";s:18:"Hawa Anak Ringkai ";s:9:"testimony";s:244:"Hola! I'm Hawa from Malaysia. It has been a great experience connecting with diverse people from different countries and backgrounds. Nice to meet you all!
